# the dice (SEL): tapped alone, the page shown rolled; held with a page's button, that layer; held alone a second, the
# last roll undone. Garden's Tempo 72 (par18), Evolve 35 (par5), Motion 50 (par15); the bells' first modulator's
# depth 20 (par74), their Gate 25 (par168)
wait 300
tap HOME
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
shot garden_dice.png
expect dirty 1
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par18 72
expect par5 35
expect par15 50
# SEL held with ARP: Voice 2 whole (its patch, how it plays, its modulators); undone as one
press SEL
tap ARP
release SEL
wait 200
shot bells_dice.png
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par74 20
expect par168 25
expect view 0
# on a voice's MOD page: the modulator picked
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
shot mod_dice.png
